      "title": "About this workflow",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Hunyuan-Image 2.1 distilled fp8 (8-step meanflow, ~5x faster)\n\n📺 Install video #5: [Install Hunyuan-Image 2.1](https://youtu.be/hxTeL8S4m2g)\n🔬 Benchmark Pillar #3: [Pillar #3](https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow#video-pillar-3-pending)\n🔬 Também em Pillar #2: [Pillar #2](https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow#video-pillar-2-pending)\n\n📥 Install: [https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow/tree/main/setup-windows](https://github.com/comfyworkflow/comfy-workflow/tree/main/setup-windows)\n- `install-hunyuan-image.bat`\n\n⚙️ Params: 8 steps, CFG 3.25, euler/normal, 2048×2048\n💾 Hardware mínimo: 32 GB RAM · 16 GB VRAM\n🎯 **Hunyuan-Image 2.1 distilled fp8 — 8-step meanflow.** UNETLoader at `fp8_e4m3fn` dtype loading `hunyuanimage2.1_distilled_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` (~17.5 GB). **8 steps**, CFG 3.25, euler/normal, **shift 4** (NOT 5). ~5× faster than Quality on RTX 5090 (~10 s warm vs ~60 s). Use for rapid iteration; promote winners to Quality for final renders.\n\n🔀 Other Hunyuan-Image 2.1 variants in this install:\n- `hunyuan_image_21_fp8.json` — fp8 Quality, 50 steps, recommended default (16 GB VRAM)\n- `hunyuan_image_21_bf16.json` — bf16 Quality, 50 steps, reference precision (32 GB VRAM)\n- `hunyuan_image_21_distilled_fp8.json` — 8-step distilled fp8, ~5× faster for iteration\n\n📐 Hunyuan-Image 2.1 is NATIVE 2K — do NOT generate at 1K (artifacts).\nEdit `EmptySD3LatentImage` width/height for other aspects:\n- 1:1   →  2048×2048\n- 16:9  →  2560×1536\n- 9:16  →  1536×2560\n- 4:3   →  2304×1792\n- 3:4   →  1792×2304\n- 3:2   →  2304×1536\n- 2:3   →  1536×2304\n\n⚙️ **Canonical config** (research-validated):\n- Sampler: `euler` · Scheduler: **`normal`** (Karras causes blurry artifacts on this model)\n- `ModelSamplingSD3` shift: **5** for full Quality, **4** for distilled\n- CFG: **3.5** for Quality, **3.25** for distilled\n- Dual text encoder: `qwen_2.5_vl_7b` (MLLM) + `byt5_small_glyphxl_fp16` (glyph-aware)\n- Negative prompt: leave empty (model doesn't use classifier-free guidance like SDXL)\n"
      ],
